                      "title": "5.9. Residual Quantization (RQ) & Additive Quantization (AQ): Kompresi Multi-Tahap",
                      "orderIndex": 9,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Residual Quantization (RQ) & Additive Quantization (AQ): Kompresi Multi-Tahap: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
